The aviation data in this package — `raw/` and the `*.generated.ts` files
compiled from it — comes from the OpenFlights dataset:

    https://github.com/jpatokal/openflights

It is licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0:

    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/

This is NOT covered by the repository's MIT licence, which applies to the
application code. The ODbL is share-alike: if you redistribute these files, or
a derived database built from them, you must keep them under the ODbL and carry
the attribution.

Attribution: airport, airline and route data from OpenFlights
(https://github.com/jpatokal/openflights), derived from OpenStreetMap
(https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright) and various government and
commercial sources.

Regenerate with `bun run data:build` from the repository root.
